            "paragraphs": {
              "transcript": "\nSpeaker 0: Good lane dispatch. Hey. This is Baraka from Tradewind Transport Incorporated. I'm calling because I got an email saying there's an issue with our insurance. Yeah.\n\nWe have your cert on file, but it shows expired or expiring very soon. We can't book you on any loads until we have an updated certificate of insurance. Oh, man. Yeah. Our renewal is in process.\n\nI think it just went through actually. Can I email you the new cert today? That would be great. Just reply to the email you got from us and attach the cert once our compliance team approves it. You're good to go.\n\nOkay. I'll do that right now. MC number is 239876. Wait. Number 219876 if you need it.\n\nThanks, Baraka. We'll keep an eye out for it. Appreciate it. Bye.",
